1
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:06,080
AY Toys — Wholesale Accounting: full walkthrough
Har feature step-by-step

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:10,000
Add Company & Theme — Create a company and give it its own colour theme.
Company add karein aur har company ka alag theme rang set karein.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,960
This is the Company List — the first screen when AY Toys opens.
App khulte hi Company List aati hai.

4
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:24,200
Click "Add Company". Type the company name and contact details.
"Add Company" par click karein, naam aur details likhein.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:30,160
Pick a theme colour for this company — here we choose Ruby Red for XYZ Toys.
Is company ka theme rang chunein — XYZ Toys ke liye laal (red).

6
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:38,200
The preview shows how the app will look. You can also pick any custom colour or Dark mode.
Preview mein dekh lein. Custom color aur Dark mode bhi mojood hai.

7
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:46,280
For this demo we tick "Load sample data" so we have customers, items, invoices and bills to work with.
Demo ke liye sample data load kar rahe hain.

8
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:49,200
The whole interface is now red — the XYZ Toys theme.
Ab poora app laal rang mein hai — XYZ Toys ka theme.

9
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:53,040
Home Page & Insights — The QuickBooks-style workflow home page and the business dashboard.
Home page aur Insights dashboard.

10
00:00:53,040 --> 00:01:02,240
The Home Page shows the QuickBooks workflow: Vendors, Customers, Company and Banking. Click any icon to open that task.
Home page par Vendors, Customers, Company aur Banking ka flow hai. Kisi bhi icon par click karein.

11
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:12,360
On the right: bank balances and Reminders — overdue invoices, bills due, low stock, purchase orders to receive.
Right side par bank balance aur reminders: overdue invoices, bills, low stock.

12
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:21,320
Insights: income, net income, what customers owe you and what you owe vendors — plus a 12-month income vs expenses chart.
Insights mein income, profit, receivable aur payable ek nazar mein.

13
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:29,640
Top customers and best-selling items. Click any bar or tile to open the report behind it.
Top customers aur best-selling items. Kisi bhi cheez par click karke report kholen.

14
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:35,360
Chart of Accounts — All your accounts with balances — press Ctrl+A.
Chart of Accounts — Ctrl+A dabayein.

15
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:45,720
Accounts are grouped by QuickBooks type: Bank, Receivable, Inventory, Payable, Equity, Income, Cost of Goods Sold and Expenses.
Har account apni type ke sath: Bank, Receivable, Inventory, Payable, Income, Expense.

16
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:55,560
Use the arrow keys to move. Press Ctrl+N (or Insert) to add a new account.
Arrow keys se move karein. Naya account: Ctrl+N ya Insert.

17
00:01:55,560 --> 00:02:03,040
We add an Expense account "Warehouse Security". You can also make it a sub-account of another account.
Expense account "Warehouse Security" bana rahe hain.

18
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:11,400
Double-click a bank account to open its register, or press Ctrl+Q for a QuickReport of the selected account.
Bank account par double-click = register. Ctrl+Q = QuickReport.

19
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:19,320
The register shows every payment and deposit with a running balance — just like QuickBooks.
Register mein har payment aur deposit running balance ke sath.

20
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:25,160
Add Inventory — The Item List and adding a new stock item with opening quantity.
Item List aur naya stock item opening quantity ke sath.

21
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:32,840
The Item List shows quantity on hand, on sales order, on purchase order, average cost, price and stock value.
Item List mein on-hand qty, average cost, price aur stock value.

22
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:39,800
Items below their reorder point are shown in red with a warning.
Reorder point se kam stock wale items laal mein dikhte hain.

23
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:55,640
New Item: choose the type "Inventory Part", then the name, SKU, category and unit.
New Item: type "Inventory Part", naam, SKU, category aur unit.

24
00:02:55,640 --> 00:03:07,960
Purchase cost and sales price — AY Toys shows the markup and margin for you.
Purchase cost aur sale price — markup aur margin khud nikal aata hai.

25
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:18,360
Set a reorder point and the opening quantity you already have in the warehouse.
Reorder point aur warehouse mein mojood opening quantity likhein.

26
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:25,600
The new item is in the list with 200 pcs on hand at Rs 250 average cost.
Naya item 200 pcs ke sath list mein aa gaya.

27
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:31,520
Customer Center — Add customers with terms, price level and credit limit.
Customer add karein — terms, price level aur credit limit.

28
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:39,120
Customer Center: the list with balances on the left, details and every transaction on the right.
Left par customers aur balance, right par details aur transactions.

29
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:56,560
Statuses show what is Paid, Open or Overdue. Double-click a transaction to open it.
Paid, Open, Overdue status. Double-click se transaction khulti hai.

30
00:03:56,560 --> 00:04:05,600
Enter the customer details. Then open "Payment Settings".
Customer ki details likhein, phir "Payment Settings" kholen.

31
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:17,120
Price level "Wholesale (-10%)" means this customer automatically gets 10% off the base price on every invoice.
Price level "Wholesale -10%": har invoice par khud 10% kam rate lagega.

32
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:23,080
Create Invoice — Make an invoice using only the keyboard — Ctrl+I.
Invoice banayein — Ctrl+I, sirf keyboard se.

33
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:32,240
Type part of the customer name and press Enter. Bill-to, terms, due date and rep fill in automatically.
Customer ka naam likh kar Enter. Address, terms aur due date khud aa jate hain.

34
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:43,000
In the Item column type a few letters — the list searches by name or SKU and shows stock on hand.
Item column mein naam ya SKU likhein — stock bhi saath dikhta hai.

35
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:55,320
Rate is 405 — the base price 450 minus the Wholesale 10%. The side panel shows stock, last price and margin.
Rate 405 hai — 450 mein se 10% wholesale discount. Side panel mein stock aur margin.

36
00:04:55,320 --> 00:05:00,640
Amount fields work like a calculator — type 2*12 and press Tab.
Amount fields calculator ki tarah — 2*12 likh kar Tab.

37
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:08,760
Totals update instantly. Now press Alt+S to Save & New (or Alt+A to Save & Close).
Total foran update. Alt+S = Save & New, Alt+A = Save & Close.

38
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:15,680
Saved! The form is ready for the next invoice. Alt+P goes back to the previous one.
Save ho gayi! Alt+P se pichli invoice wapas.

39
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:26,880
Ctrl+Y shows the transaction journal — the debits and credits behind this invoice, including Cost of Goods Sold.
Ctrl+Y: is invoice ka journal — debit aur credit, COGS ke sath.

40
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:35,200
Use Print for a printable invoice, Memorize (Ctrl+M) for repeat orders, and History (Ctrl+H) for linked payments.
Print, Memorize (Ctrl+M) aur History (Ctrl+H) bhi yahin hain.

41
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:41,400
Receive Payments — Record money received and apply it to invoices.
Customer se aayi payment record karein.

42
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:46,600
Clicking "Receive Pmt" opens Receive Payments with this customer and invoice already selected.
"Receive Pmt" se payment window customer aur invoice ke sath khulti hai.

43
00:05:46,600 --> 00:06:05,440
Let’s say Joy Toys paid Rs 30,000 now. Type the amount — it is auto-applied to the oldest invoice.
Joy Toys ne 30,000 diye. Amount likhein — khud oldest invoice par lag jata hai.

44
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:09,480
The invoice now shows the payment applied and the remaining balance due.
Invoice par payment aur baqi balance nazar aata hai.

45
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:15,320
Purchase Order → Receive → Bill — Order stock from a vendor, receive it and create the bill.
Vendor se maal order karein, receive karein aur bill banayein.

46
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:30,440
Teddy Bears are low on stock. We create a Purchase Order to Karachi Plastic Works.
Teddy Bear ka stock kam hai — Purchase Order bana rahe hain.

47
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:34,480
Ordered quantities show as "On P.O." in the Item List until they arrive.
Order ki hui qty Item List mein "On P.O." dikhti hai.

48
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:41,440
When the goods arrive, click "Receive & Bill" — the bill is created from the PO.
Maal aane par "Receive & Bill" — PO se bill khud ban jata hai.

49
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:53,160
The Items tab is filled from the PO. Saving adds 100 bears to stock and updates the average cost.
Items tab PO se bhar gaya. Save par stock aur average cost update.

50
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:59,000
Add Bill & Pay Bills — Enter an expense bill from a vendor and pay bills.
Vendor ka expense bill aur bills ki payment.

51
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:08,840
Enter Bills: choose the vendor. Terms and due date come from the vendor.
Enter Bills: vendor chunein — terms aur due date khud aate hain.

52
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:26,040
On the Expenses tab choose the expense account and amount — here the electricity bill under Utilities.
Expenses tab mein account aur amount — bijli ka bill "Utilities".

53
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:34,040
Pay Bills lists every unpaid bill with its due date. Overdue ones are red.
Pay Bills mein saare unpaid bills — overdue laal.

54
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:42,320
Tick the bills to pay, choose the bank account, and click "Pay Selected Bills".
Bills tick karein, bank account chunein, "Pay Selected Bills".

55
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:48,160
Sales Receipt, Deposit & Checks — Cash sales, bank deposits, write checks and adjust stock.
Cash sale, bank deposit, checks aur stock adjustment.

56
00:07:48,160 --> 00:08:05,760
A Sales Receipt is a cash sale — paid on the spot. The money waits in Undeposited Funds.
Sales Receipt = cash sale. Paisa "Undeposited Funds" mein jata hai.

57
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:17,000
Make Deposits: select the payments you are taking to the bank and save.
Make Deposits: jo payments bank le ja rahe hain unhe select karein.

58
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:37,120
Write Checks (Alt+K — the browser reserves Ctrl+W): pay expenses straight from the bank, like warehouse rent.
Write Checks (Alt+K): seedha bank se kharcha — jaise kiraya.

59
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:52,280
Adjust Quantity on Hand: record damaged or missing stock. The value goes to Inventory Shrinkage.
Toota hua ya kam stock adjust karein — "Inventory Shrinkage" mein jata hai.

60
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:58,640
Reports — Customer & vendor balances, Profit & Loss, Balance Sheet and more.
Customer/Vendor balance, Profit & Loss, Balance Sheet aur bohat se reports.

61
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:02,720
Customer Balance Summary: how much every customer owes you right now.
Customer Balance Summary: har customer ka baqaya.

62
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:07,960
Double-click any line to QuickZoom into the details.
Kisi bhi line par double-click — detail khul jati hai.

63
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:15,600
Customer Balance Detail: every invoice and payment with a running balance.
Customer Balance Detail: har invoice aur payment running balance ke sath.

64
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:21,560
Vendor Balance Summary: how much you owe each vendor.
Vendor Balance Summary: aap ne kis vendor ko kitna dena hai.

65
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:28,600
Profit & Loss (Income Statement): Income, Cost of Goods Sold, Gross Profit, Expenses and Net Income.
Profit & Loss: income, COGS, gross profit, expenses aur net income.

66
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:36,800
Change the date range from the Dates list: This Month, Last Quarter, This Fiscal Year and more.
Dates list se date range badlein — This Month, Last Quarter waghera.

67
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:47,320
Double-click an amount — here Sales — to see every transaction behind it.
Kisi amount par double-click — us ke peeche ki transactions.

68
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:56,880
Balance Sheet: Assets = Liabilities + Equity. Net Income for the year is included in Equity.
Balance Sheet: Assets = Liabilities + Equity.

69
00:09:56,880 --> 00:10:07,280
Every report can be printed, exported to Excel and memorized with its settings.
Har report Print, Excel export aur Memorize ho sakti hai.

70
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:19,080
Report Center: 50+ reports grouped like QuickBooks — aging, sales by item, inventory valuation, trial balance…
Report Center: 50 se zyada reports — aging, sales by item, inventory waghera.

71
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:23,960
Stock Status shows what to reorder and a suggested quantity for each item.
Stock Status: kya reorder karna hai aur kitna.

72
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:30,160
Keyboard Shortcuts & Find — QuickBooks shortcut keys, menus and search.
QuickBooks shortcut keys, menus aur search.

73
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:38,840
Press F1 any time for the full shortcut list: Ctrl+I invoice, Ctrl+J customers, Ctrl+A accounts, Alt+S save…
F1 dabayein — saari shortcut keys ki list.

74
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:51,480
Date fields have QuickBooks keys too: T = today, + / - = next / previous day, M = month start, H = month end.
Date field mein: T = aaj, + / - = agla/pichla din, M = mahine ka shuru.

75
00:10:51,480 --> 00:11:00,760
Alt + the underlined letter opens a menu (Alt+F, Alt+C, Alt+U, Alt+R…). Use the arrow keys and Enter.
Alt + underline letter se menu khulta hai. Arrow keys aur Enter.

76
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:10,880
Find (Ctrl+F) searches every transaction by number, name, memo, item or amount.
Find (Ctrl+F): number, naam, memo ya amount se kuch bhi dhoondhein.

77
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:16,800
Multiple Companies — Add a second company with a different theme and switch between them.
Doosri company alag theme ke sath, aur dono mein switch.

78
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:39,920
Ctrl+O opens the Company List. Add a second company — ABC Toys — with the green theme.
Ctrl+O: Company List. Doosri company ABC Toys hara (green) theme ke sath.

79
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:45,640
ABC Toys opens in green with its own empty books — separate customers, items and reports.
ABC Toys green mein, apne alag books ke sath.

80
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:53,440
Use "Quick switch" in the title bar to jump between companies. Each one keeps its own colour.
Title bar mein "Quick switch" se company badlein — har ek ka apna rang.

81
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:59,280
Back in XYZ Toys — red again.
Wapas XYZ Toys — phir se laal.

82
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:09,360
You can change a company theme any time: Company › Theme & Appearance. Changes apply instantly.
Theme kabhi bhi badlein: Company › Theme & Appearance.

83
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:17,600
Purple and Dark mode… and back to Ruby Red, light.
Purple aur Dark mode… phir wapas laal.

84
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:23,840
Google Sheets & Backup — Connect the Google Sheet database and back up your data.
Google Sheet database connect karein aur backup lein.

85
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:34,280
Right now data is saved on this computer ("Local only"). Paste your Apps Script Web App URL here to sync to Google Sheets.
Abhi data isi computer par hai. Apps Script URL paste karein — Google Sheet se sync.

86
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:45,160
Setup Guide: create a Google Sheet, open Extensions › Apps Script, paste this code, deploy as a Web app for "Anyone".
Google Sheet banayein, Extensions › Apps Script, ye code paste karein, Web app deploy.

87
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:51,520
Each company gets its own tabs in the sheet. Changes upload in the background and retry automatically when offline.
Har company ke alag tabs. Internet na ho to baad mein khud upload.

88
00:12:51,520 --> 00:13:01,040
File › Back Up Company downloads a full backup file; File › Restore Backup brings it back.
File › Back Up se poora backup download; Restore se wapas.

89
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:06,000
AY Toys is ready — press F1 in the app for all shortcut keys.
